      "key": [
        "Izmaylov pen",
        "Aksinya's pen",
        "Sharpness That Ceased Upon Wondrous Creation"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Izmaylov: Aksinya and the pen",
      "content": "Aksinya placed her pen in the young Domovoy's hand among the frozen ruins of Hyperborea inside the Shadow Realm. The artifact text says she was a girl no longer, spoke of seeing by the fire's light rather than inheriting it, and offered her bones as a step for those who came after. The pen made his devotion real. Centuries later, when she returned, he handed it back and released them both from debt.",
