    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Alvis Izmaylov",
        "Domovoy Grand Duke",
        "Izmaylov and Alvis"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Izmaylov: Rivalry with Alvis",
      "content": "Alvis posted Izmaylov to Hvergelmir to spy. After Aksinya's reported death, Izmaylov refused to believe it and used the Tsaritsa's new regime to take the Energy Commission presidency before Alvis could. From then on they opposed each other in council. Their disagreement over the first Director of the Transport Bureau ended with Alvis stepping back and Izmaylov being proved right by the Luchkin.",
