        "High Table",
        "Fae Gang Federation"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Izmaylov: The High Table",
      "content": "After crushing the Burner of Cities, Izmaylov and the surviving heroes swore to live under the Law amid soot and rust, which formed the High Table. He meant his adopted children to take the gangs. The Speaker's seat passed to Zmei when he withdrew.",
